    <string name="a11y_title">Accessibility service</string>
    <string name="a11y_desc">Reads the screen and taps, swipes and types for the commands you send from your PC.</string>
    <string name="a11y_restricted">Android 13 and later lock this switch for apps installed outside an app store. If it is greyed out, open App info, tap the three-dot menu, choose Allow restricted settings, then try again.</string>
    <string name="a11y_service_description">Lets the PC you paired read this screen and tap, swipe and type on it. Commands are accepted only from the paired PC, over an encrypted link.</string>

